<title>GERMANY: Kloeckner H1 ord profit 16 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Kloeckner H1 ord profit 16 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBURG, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half to March 31 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    16	vs 4 loss</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,059   vs 2,185</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    2,193   vs 2,226</p>
<p>NOTE - German machinery maker Kloeckner Werke AG said for the full year it expected to post income from ordinary activities of 50 million marks, and pretax profit of 200 million marks, compared with 49.3 million marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
